# Caddy is the reverse proxy / TLS terminator for the production/staging deployment (see
# docker-compose.prod.yml). It automatically obtains and renews a Let's Encrypt certificate for
# the domain(s) below the first time they're requested — no manual certbot/nginx config needed.
#
# Currently pointed at the pre-cutover test domain (winordie.net). Once ready to go live, add (or
# switch to) swordsandravens.net here — Caddy will request a new certificate for it automatically,
# no other changes required. Multiple domains can point at the same site block, comma-separated.
winordie.net {
	reverse_proxy website:8000
}
